WEBVTT

00:04:58.454 --> 00:05:00.910
and make this knowledge commonplace,

00:05:00.934 --> 00:05:04.555
we actually risk losing the ability

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:08.626
to use space for humanity's benefit.

00:05:10.393 --> 00:05:11.552
Thank you very much.

00:05:11.576 --> 00:05:16.206
(Applause and cheers)